# Prideful Parent: "When this creature enters, create a 1/1 white Cat creature token." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 off three Moxen
# and Bot1 alone gets the token (CR 111.2: the ability's controller creates it): a 1/1 white Cat creature, with no abilities, that
# is a token and not a card. The Parent itself is a 2/2 and Bot2 (who has a Mox of their own and no creature) gets nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Prideful Parent
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Island x20

